# Rimuru's "Weird autoreactor" (original by Selkn). in9 = Responsiveness/Efficiency lever: it MUST be wired (a lever sends its state every tick).
#   lever 1: turbine follows load, fission = 75*turbine/fuel.  lever 0: turbine 100, output throttled by temperature.
reactor in0 reactor.temperature_out
reactor in1 reactor.power_value_out
reactor in2 reactor.load_value_out
reactor in3 reactor.fuel_out
reactor in4 reactor.fuel_percentage_left
reactor out0 reactor.set_turbineoutput
reactor out1 reactor.set_fissionrate
reactor out2 none
reactor out3 none
reactor out4 none
reactor out5 none
reactor in9 const.0
